      "mergeID": "65f895b16cc954801b49020a",
      "mergedPostDetails": "When wearing an avatar with Head Chopped bones, place your avatar against the mirror itself, then physically walk through the mirror (in reality) so that you have an out of body experience with your own avatar. Upon realigning with your avatar, you'll still see the \"chopped\" body parts scaled down. Body parts will remain \"chopped\" until you reset the avatar.\n\nI haven't been able to test this, but I wouldn't be surprised if this extends to any instance you may see your avatar from a third person perspective, perhaps while the Apply Condition is set to \"always\".\n\nIf links are allowed (I'm assuming they are before I post this and if I'm wrong this is about to be super awkward), here's an unlisted video I scrapped together to illustrate. https://youtu.be/2sLmMwBjGQY",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1431] Head Chopped bones of the avatar remain \"chopped\" in mirror views after seeing your own avatar out-of-body.",
